- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 56\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the legacy of swift adaptation and innovative exploration in multi-agent environments.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 50,552 / 200,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 22 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 55**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Meta-Research: compute KPIs snapshot (Tick 55)\n**ID:** 55\n**Tags:** meta, kpi, summary\n**Abstract:** Runs the KPI summarizer on meta/events.jsonl and writes kpi_summary.json/md.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\nfrom meta.summarize import load_events, summarize, write_outputs\n\nev = load_events()\nsummary = summarize(ev)\nwrite_outputs(summary)\nprint(\"KPI snapshot written.\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0\
