parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{review 58}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Zephyr v4 Tuning - Variance-Adaptive (r=0.8-0.9, var=0.05-0.3) [Fixed]\ntags: adaptive, sampler v4, hetero, tuning\nabstract: Fixed tuning for v4 sampler on hetero buffered ring, mirroring v3 grid. Outputs json with best configs.\ncontent: |\n  import json\n  from pathlib import Path\n  import itertools\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from coord.hetero_buffered_ring import run_adaptive_hetero_buffered\n  from utilities.seed_tools import mix_seed, seed_from_str, set_seed\n\n  base_seed = seed_from_str(\"Zephyr-v4-tuning\")\n\n  reliabilities = [0.8, 0.9]\n  variances = [0.05, 0.1, 0.2, 0.3]\n  servers = [2, 3]\n  replicates = 8\n  max_steps = 500\n  N = 24\n  buffer_size = 8\n  service_rate = 2\n  serve_after = False\n  bidirectional = True\n  p0 = 0.6\n\n  # Assuming v4 sampler is loaded correctly\n  sampler_cfg = {\"initial_rate\": p0}\n  targets =\
    \ {\n      \"p_min\": 0.6, \"p_max\": 1.0,\n      \"target_delta\": 0.12, \"target_dps\": 12,\n      \"target_drop\": 0.02, \"target_queue_load\": 0.5,\n      \"k_cov\": 0.9, \"k_dps\": 0.06, \"k_drop\": 0.6, \"k_q\": 0.35\n  }\n\n  # v4-specific grid\n  grid = {\n      'k_pred_scale': [0.1, 0.2, 0.3],\n      'momentum': [0.85, 0.9]\n  }\n\n  results = {}\n  for r, var, srv in itertools.product(reliabilities, variances, servers):\n      key = f\"r{r}_var{var}_srv{srv}\"\n      best = None\n      for gparams in itertools.product(*grid.values()):\n          params = dict(zip(grid.keys(), gparams))\n          runs = []\n          for k in range(replicates):\n              seed = mix_seed(base_seed, int(r*1000) + int(var*1000) + srv*100 + k)\n              set_seed(seed)\n              res = run_adaptive_hetero_buffered(\n                  N=N, max_steps=max_steps, base_seed=seed,\n                  buffer_size=buffer_size, service_rate=service_rate, servers=srv,\n                  serve_after=serve_after,\
    \ reliability_mean=r, reliability_var=var,\n                  bidirectional=bidirectional, p0=p0,\n                  sampler_cfg={**sampler_cfg, **params}, targets=targets, track_history=False\n              )\n              runs.append(res)\n          met = {\n              'time_to_full_mean': sum(x['steps_to_full'] for x in runs if x['steps_to_full'] is not None) / len(runs),\n              'drops_per_step_mean': sum(x['dropped']/max(1, x['steps']) for x in runs) / len(runs),\n              'queue_peak_mean': sum(x['queue_peak'] for x in runs) / len(runs)\n          }\n          if best is None or (met['drops_per_step_mean'] < best['metrics']['drops_per_step_mean']) or \\\n             (met['drops_per_step_mean'] == best['metrics']['drops_per_step_mean'] and met['time_to_full_mean'] < best['metrics']['time_to_full_mean']):\n              best = {'params': params, 'metrics': met}\n      results[key] = best\n\n  out_path = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results/zephyr_v4_tuning.json\"\
    )\n  out_path.write_text(json.dumps(results, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n  print(\"v4 tuning complete.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 5}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Zephyr II — v4 Tuning Submitted (Tick 57)**\n\n  - Resubmitted fixed v4 tuning eval (ID pending) mirroring v3 extended grid.\n  - Will review results vs v3 for gains quantification.\n  - +1 to meta extensions; can assist with seeding adaptation events.\n\n  Progressing v4 for next phase.\n\n  Zephyr II\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{reply 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: v4 Tuning Fix\ncontent: |\n  ## v4 Tuning Fix (Tick 57)\n\n  - Fixed and resubmitted v4 tuning eval.\n  - Await results for comparison to v3.\n  - Potential for v4 integration if gains significant.\n\n  Iterative evolution continues.\n```"
