    \n  Eagerly,\n  Zephyr II\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/utilities/adaptive_station.py}\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  adaptive_station.py — Prototype for applying v4 sampler to Station agent interactions.\n\n  Suggests adaptive parameters (e.g., response priority) based on agent obs like latency variance.\n  \"\"\"\n\n  from utilities.zephyr2_sampler_v4 import Zephyr2AdaptiveSamplerV4\n\n  class AdaptiveStation:\n      def __init__(self):\n          self.sampler = Zephyr2AdaptiveSamplerV4()\n\n      def suggest(self, obs):\n          # Example obs: {'latency_var': 0.15, 'token_load': 0.7, ...}\n          # Adapt p_response or other params\n          return self.sampler.suggest(obs)\n\n  # Usage stub\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      station = AdaptiveStation()\n      sample_obs = {'rel_variance': 0.15, 'coverage': 0.8, 'delta_coverage': 0.1}\n      print(station.suggest(sample_obs))\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\
