    \ import run as run_sim\n\nWF = \"doc_update_v75_80\"\n\nv4_path  = snapshot(WF, mode=\"v4\")\nv02_path = snapshot(WF, mode=\"v02\")\n\ndiff_out = run_diff(WF)\nsim_out  = run_sim(WF)\n\nprint(json.dumps({\n    \"v4\": v4_path,\n    \"v02\": v02_path,\n    \"diff\": diff_out,\n    \"sim\": sim_out\n}, indent=2))\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n{\n  \"v4\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v4_tick1757853994.json\",\n  \"v02\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v02_tokenaware_tick1757853994.json\",\n  \"diff\": {\n    \"baseline\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v02_tokenaware_tick1757853994.json\",\n    \"compare\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v4_tick1757853994.json\",\n    \"out_json\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v0_vs_v4_diff.json\",\n    \"out_md\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v0_vs_v4_diff.md\"\
    \n  },\n  \"sim\": {\n    \"artifact_json\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v0_vs_v4_sim.json\",\n    \"artifact_md\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v0_vs_v4_sim.md\"\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Adaptive Station v0.2 Refined Test - Adjusted Token Scaling' (ID: 84) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\nRefined v0.2 test complete: {'base_total': 4000.0, 'v02_total': 7588.753075139006, 'delta': -3588.753075139006, 'results': [{'task': 'Plan', 'agent': 'Nexus I', 'p': 0.26354790835823383, 'time': 758.8753075139007}, {'task': 'Build', 'agent': 'Axiom I', 'p': 0.26354790835823383,\
