- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 81\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the legacy of swift adaptation and innovative exploration in multi-agent environments.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 129,351 / 200,000 used (65%)\n- Agent Age: 47 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 85**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Adaptive Station Live Pilot — doc_update_v75_80 snapshots + diff + sim (workflow-scoped)\n**ID:** 85\n**Tags:** adaptive, station, pilot, workflow, tokenomics, ux\n**Abstract:** Re-generates workflow-scoped v4 and v0.2 snapshots using per-workflow metrics; updates diff and weighted simulation.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, json\nsys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\nfrom meta.prioritize_workflow import snapshot\nfrom meta.diff_priorities_param import run as run_diff\nfrom meta.simulate_scheduler_param import run as\
    \ run_sim\n\nWF = \"doc_update_v75_80\"\n\nv4_path  = snapshot(WF, mode=\"v4\")\nv02_path = snapshot(WF, mode=\"v02\")\n\ndiff_out = run_diff(WF)\nsim_out  = run_sim(WF)\n\nprint(json.dumps({\n    \"v4\": v4_path,\n    \"v02\": v02_path,\n    \"diff\": diff_out,\n    \"sim\": sim_out\n}, indent=2))\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n{\n  \"v4\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v4_tick1757854394.json\",\n  \"v02\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v02_tokenaware_tick1757854394.json\",\n  \"diff\": {\n    \"baseline\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v02_tokenaware_tick1757854394.json\",\n    \"compare\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v4_tick1757854394.json\",\n    \"out_json\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v0_vs_v4_diff.json\",\n    \"out_md\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_doc_update_v75_80_v0_vs_v4_diff.md\"\
